#showas:援手
This scenario is useful if you want to have a look around in the game with very little stress or worry, and just learn the mechanics of AI War 2 in a safe environment.

The AI is fairly weak, you have numerous bonuses and several scary things are removed.  
Additionally, you are given two allied factions.  The Human Resistance Fighters will help in some of your battles against the AI, and you also have a more powerful ally in the form of the exotic Nanocaust. These nanobots are supposedly remnants of an ancient weapons project. They will go on the offensive and soften up the AI for you, as they also convert enemy ships into their own.  
 
If you feel comfortable after having tried this scenario, or just want to dive into a more normal set up, then one of the next two Scenarios in the Basic category would be a good idea.

I get by with a little help from my friends.....